      "message": "test(app): order the lathe rough ahead of its finish in the field-sim fixture\n\nThe fixture named its ops PR1 and PF1. CreateOperation stores no\nexplicit position, so operation_order breaks the tie by name and PF1\nsorted ahead of PR1: the finish was created in front of the already\ngenerated rough. Since #109 (PR #153) every unposed op's stamp reads\nthe program ahead, so PR1's stamp gained a prior term and it correctly\nread Stale - the stamp's tool, params, source and stock terms were\nunchanged, only the prior digest was new.\n\nRename the ops R1/S1 (the lathe_post fixture's names) and assert the\nprogram order, so the fixture machines rough then finish.\n\nFixes #186\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
